  "limitations": [
    "Vault storage does not isolate credentials from same-user processes or local agent tools. Signed-parent authentication is not implemented.",
    "Live host credential-prompt acceptance, the DSH credential-vault bridge, full Hermes parity, macOS VoiceOver, physical-device accessibility and multi-hour soaks/reconnect replay remain open.",
    "Real-account model/image acceptance and physical Android/16 KB execution remain open.",
    "The framework documents no Linux screen-reader bridge; native semantics tests do not prove screen-reader interoperability.",
    "Resource samples cover the local host and its live descendants, excluding the UI JVM and unsampled transient children. Three cycles are a bounded baseline, not multi-hour performance acceptance."
